      star: [user]
    notes:
      - created: "+2d 18:00"
        content: |
          **Signal - Hal**

          "Landing at Reagan Wednesday 3pm. Where should we have dinner?"

          **Me:** "Somewhere quiet. No work talk."

          **Hal:** "Is that possible for us?"

          **Me:** "We can try."

          **Hal:** "I'll make a reservation. You just show up."

          **Me:** "Deal."

          Looking forward to this. Actual time together. No time zones. No video lag. Just... us.
        source:
          type: secure_message
          title: Signal - Hal
        mentions:
          - hal

